# Judge3-2-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile1,ArmR2,ArmL5
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"从汉娜的<br>尸体状况来看，<br>这毫无疑问是<br><link=\"Objection_01_03_02_01\">【上吊自杀】</link>。|#0103Trial02_Margo001|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile1,ArmR2,ArmL5
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:现场不仅有绳子，<br>还有可以用来垫高的<br>物品……|#0103Trial02_Margo002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile1,ArmR4,ArmL5
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"而且就像刚才<br>讨论的那样，<br>汉娜是<br><link=\"Objection_01_03_02_02\">能够使用飘浮魔法</link>的。|#0103Trial02_Margo003|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile1,ArmR2,ArmL5
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:汉娜她自己<br>就能套上绳子，<br>根本不需要借助外物。|#0103Trial02_Margo004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"……不过要说有什么<br>可疑之处的话，<br>房间里有些<link=\"Objection_01_03_02_03\">凌乱</link>，<br>这一点确实<br>不太寻常呢？|#0103Trial02_Margo005|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR1,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Middle,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"不过如果汉娜是陷入<br><link=\"Objection_01_03_02_04\">精神错乱</link>而自杀，<br>那弄乱了房间的是她<br>也没什么好奇怪。|#0103Trial02_Margo006|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR1,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Middle,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"这一切都能用<br>汉娜的自杀<br>来解释……<br>我觉得，在招待所里，<br>再也没有除此以外的<br>任何<link=\"Objection_01_03_02_05\">异常</link>了，你们说呢？|#0103Trial02_Margo007|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4


@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-First
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:true ProcessTimer:true
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-Last

