@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:现场还悬挂着结成环状的绳索。|#0103Trial02_Margo010| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

