@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:还有那些围绕着尸体悬挂的人偶……<br>也许，是因为汉娜感到寂寞<br>才会挂在现场的。|#0103Trial02_Margo011| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR7,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:【上吊自杀】……非常浅显易懂的选择。<br>她选择带人偶一起上路，而不是我们，<br>这正体现了她的温柔呢。|#0103Trial02_Margo012| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

